{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0be2ff09ffec7694","name":"Vo'ren's Third Cadence","source":{"id":"source:reference-0be2ff09ffec7694","title":"Vo'ren's Third Cadence","revision":20572,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:06:32Z","sha256":"aac22de7b91411e5571dbe6c16465356e100d7f31112de4174a1881ef21b0014","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20572","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Vo%27ren%27s%20Third%20Cadence&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0be2ff09ffec7694","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Vo'ren's Third Cadence"]}," teaches advanced precision through control of one's body and sensory awareness. You set up 180 wax cylinders at 2-degree intervals around your body, each one approximately 1.5 meters away. Atop each cylinder, one metal ball bearing is placed. Unlike ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Vo'ren's Second Cadence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vo%27ren%27s_Second_Cadence","referenceId":"reference:c676da80fcf0e52c"}]},", in the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Third Cadence"]}," you must strike every fifth ball bearing, making a rotation around your body several times over the course of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Regimen"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Regimen"},". This prepares you for irregular attack patterns from all sides.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," 3 Hours\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," Self\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Requirements:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", 180 wax cylinders, and 16,290 ball bearings.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"ta