"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," rolls made when using the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Redirect Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Redirect_Shot"}]}," Talent, and you can spend ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," to enhance ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks to ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Block"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Block"}]}," or ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Deflect"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deflect"}]},", even when it is not your turn. Furthermore, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," spent in this manner do not count toward the \"one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," per round\" limit normally applied to spending ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},".\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
